# speepobox-template: .gitignore v4 sha256:85f8ed93cdba
# Everything in the speepobox directory except the committed config layer and
# this file: the operator's private settings, the agent credential, and this
# repo's runtime state. `config.toml` is the layer that travels with the repo
# (05 Q4); nothing below does.
#
# Committed before T58 moved the credential read here (19 §3), so that no
# `git add -A` in the gap between the two can commit a token.

# The operator's own config layer, which beats the committed one and is
# nobody else's business.
/config.local.toml
# The agent credential; unanchored, so one anywhere below is never committed.
.env
# Runtime state: the runtime root defaults to this directory (T57), so the
# logs, the locks, the checkouts, and the ledger land here.
/logs/
/locks/
/checkouts/
/runs.jsonl
# The editor's session directories, `<purpose>-edit-<pid>-XXXXXX/` at the
# runtime root (T84, T108). They hold the dispatcher's own text while it is
# being written. Anchored, so nothing under the tasks dir can match.
/*-edit-*/
# A refresh's temp file, `<file>.refresh`, left only if a refresh was
# killed between its write and its rename (T147). Unanchored, so one under
# image/ matches too.
*.refresh
